# Copy to .env and fill in for REAL mode. MOCK mode needs none of these.
AGENT_MODE=mock              # mock (offline, fixtures) | real
AGENT_AUTONOMY=draft_only    # draft_only (default). auto_send is intentionally unimplemented.

# Required only when AGENT_MODE=real:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Search needs NO second key or vendor: real mode uses the Claude API's
# server-side web_search tool, billed to ANTHROPIC_API_KEY above.
#
# There is no spend cap in this system. The knobs below control search DEPTH and
# LATENCY, not cost ceilings -- raising them finds more venues per region and
# makes each region slower and pricier.
#   SEARCH_MAX_USES  searches per region (default 5). ~2.5 min and ~$0.20 per
#                    region at 3; scales roughly linearly.
#   SEARCH_MODEL     must support web_search_20260209 (Sonnet 5 / Opus 4.6+).
#                    Haiku 4.5 does NOT, so search cannot run on MODEL_CHEAP.
# SEARCH_MAX_USES=5
# SEARCH_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- Gmail (only for sending inquiries in REAL mode) -------------------------
# OAuth only. There is no password anywhere in this system, and the only scope
# requested is gmail.send -- it cannot read your mail.
#
# One-time setup:
#   1. Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> enable the Gmail API
#   2. Create an OAuth client ID, type "Desktop app", download the JSON
#   3. Save it as credentials.json in the repo root (git-ignored)
#   4. python -m src.sending --authorize     -> writes token.json (git-ignored)
#
# Both files are git-ignored by default; set these only to move them elsewhere.
# GMAIL_CREDENTIALS_PATH=credentials.json
# GMAIL_TOKEN_PATH=token.json

# Where "already emailed this venue" is remembered, so a rerun cannot offer to
# contact the same venue twice. Git-ignored.
# SENT_LEDGER_PATH=sent_log.json

# Optional: override the models the AGENT calls at runtime (defaults are best).
# MODEL_WORKHORSE=claude-sonnet-5
# MODEL_CHEAP=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
#
# NOTE: the model that BUILDS this repo is chosen in Claude Code, not here:
#   claude --model claude-opus-5      (everyday-strong)
#   /model fable                      (Fable 5, top tier, for a one-session build)
